<title>USA: FAC Realty names C. Cammack Morton CEO.</title>
<headline>FAC Realty names C. Cammack Morton CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SMITHFIELD, N.C. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAC Realty Trust Inc said on Thursday that it named C. Cammack Morton as the chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Morton, who is currently president and chief operating officer, replaces J Dixon Fleming Jr.</p>
<p>Fleming resigns as chief executive officer, effective December 31, 1996 but will remain as the chairman of the company's board, it said.</p>
<p>Morton joined FAC Realty early this year.</p>
<p>FAC Realty Trust is a self-administered real estate investment trust (REIT).</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
